 "strategy": "before I get started, I’d like to say that yes I know I have no starting effect. This is b/c the only one I have is the Vfrom dag, and I don’t like losing force to play those pretty invisible shields I don’t have.\n\nAnyway, on to the strategy. Get Luke, Yoda, and other stuff w/objective, get Luke started. Start a race when ever viable. Before and after winning the race, get leia, obi, and qui set up at the arena, once Luke is finished pull him of dag and switch him out for the reb scout (so I don’t have to lose to use the upside down card). Set up the asteroid fields around kessel, spread out through the field, drain at kessel and sector while making them lose force to asteroids. oh and by the way leia and the rest, they are to be force draining.That’s basically it, I hope you like this version better.",
